gaEo(){return"From trail to trail"},
gaEn(){return"Plan a loop and tap \u201cNavigate\u201d: at the top you see how far and how much climbing it is to the next trail head; at the head the grade, the condition and your buddy\u2019s note. At the bottom the loop as a band."},
